    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Field Identification Protocols.</strong> You have codified checklists and procedures for safely interrogating the symbolic layer.</p><ul><li>When you participate in a <strong>Spark or Tikkun Identification</strong> roll (whatever ability/skill combination your table uses), you can add a <strong>+2 bonus</strong> to one such roll per scene.</li><li>On the campaign layer, this feature is the hook for your <strong>Tier 2 “+2 to Identification”</strong> behavior: scripts and macros can look for this flag and modify Identification rolls accordingly.</li></ul>",
